# [FRONTEND] Architecture

Source of truth: `CLAUDE.md`. Trello "Not MPV" wins on conflict.

## Folder layout (mandatory)

- Domain code: `frontend/src/features/<domain>/{components,hooks,types,utils}` (+ `context/` only for auth).
- Thin pages: `frontend/src/pages/` — wire hooks + components only. **No** fetch/mutations/heavy logic in pages.
- Shell: `frontend/src/app/{layout,router,providers}` only.
- Cross-feature: `frontend/src/shared/{components,hooks,services,utils,types,store,config}` with barrel `index.ts` when the folder already uses one.
- Domain constant maps (labels/colors/icons, not functions): flat file under `shared/` (e.g. `orderStatus.constants.ts`), import by path — **not** via barrel.
- Path alias: `@/*` → `src/*`. No long relative imports across features.
- `inbox` / `communication` = empty scaffold (Not MPV). Do not build unified inbox / ChannelAdapter / conversation UI.

## Routing & exports

- Pages: **only** `export default function XPage()`.
- Everything else: **only** named exports.
- New page requires `lazyPage(() => import('@/pages/XPage'))` in `app/router/index.tsx`.

## Design system & UI surface

- Prefer `shared/components` (`SincraButton`, `Input`, `Select`, `SincraModal`, `ConfirmDeleteModal`, `Table`, `Tabs`, `Drawer`, `EmptyState`, `KpiCardsRow`, `DateRangeFilter`, …).
- Do not invent a parallel button/modal/input if shared already has one.
- Colors/typography: tokens in `frontend/src/index.css`. No ad-hoc hex in Tailwind except ECharts canvas (CSS vars do not resolve there).
- Icons: `lucide-react` (AI agent avatars = PNGs in `public/`).
- UI copy in **Spanish**. Avoid technical jargon ("OAuth", internal API names) unless the screen already uses it.
- Desktop-first. Sidebar stays `max-md:hidden` unless explicitly asked to change. Tables may scroll horizontally — do not block on mobile card redesigns.
- Map: OpenStreetMap only (no CARTO). Keep `divIcon`, `isolate`, `clients-map.css`. Layer toggle is **binary** (Clients | Orders). Clients `primary`, orders `primary-dark`. `approximate` = no written address.

## State & data flow

- Remote: TanStack Query in feature hooks. Hierarchical keys: `['clients']`, `['clients','map',filters]`, `['orders', id]`.
- Mutations invalidate via feature helpers (`invalidateClientQueries`, `invalidateOrderQueries`) — not the whole tree.
- Shared filters `channel` / `dateFrom` / `dateTo` (Map/Stats/Orders): only `shared/store/filtersStore`. Page-local filters stay local.
- Tests touching the store: `useFiltersStore.getState().clearFilters()` in `beforeEach`.
- HTTP: only `api` from `@/shared/services` with `credentials: 'include'`. No bare `fetch` to the API.
- Toasts: `notifySuccess` / `notifyError` / `notifyWithUndo` only.
- Never store JWT in `localStorage` (httpOnly cookie auth).

## Feature ownership

- Keep Client and Order separate. Near-copy Notes/Tags tabs are OK; do not force a mega shared ClientOrOrder abstraction without an explicit decision.
- Reuse shared when the pattern is already cross-cutting (`NotesTab`, `DateRangeFilter`, `ConfirmDeleteModal`).

## Forbidden (Not MPV)

No unified inbox, Meta channel adapters, interactive Automations toggles, Stripe paywall, real sessions UI, real notification delivery. Automations page = static Sincra/Sincro info (no Hermes in UI).
